# showHelp(Player player)
# Bind to a button/sign at the hub. Prints a short how-to and the questions
# people actually ask, short enough to read without scrolling chat off the
# screen. The web address is clickable, as in showLink.
#
# Text components use the 1.21.5+ shape: `click_event`/`hover_event` rather
# than `clickEvent`/`hoverEvent`, and `open_url` carries `url` rather than
# `value`. On an older server rename those fields.

@using rymaphub
@fast

@player
@player &#936be5&lRY's Map Hub &8- &#d4d4d4Tutorial
@player
@player &e&l1. &#d4d4d4Open the web page and upload an image.
@bypass tellraw {{player}} ["",{"text":"","color":"#d4d4d4"},{"text":"rysanders18.github.io/rymaphub","color":"#936be5","underlined":true,"click_event":{"action":"open_url","url":"https://rysanders18.github.io/rymaphub/"},"hover_event":{"action":"show_text","value":[{"text":"Click to open in your browser","color":"#a1a1a1"}]}}]
@player
@player &e&l2. &#d4d4d4Adjust your image. &#d4d4d4Dithering blends colours, staircasing
@player &#d4d4d4builds in 3D for better colors.
@player
@player &e&l3. &#d4d4d4Click the import button here, then copy each
@player &#d4d4d4message and paste it into chat, in order.
@player
@player &#d4d4d4● Press &#d4d4d4'&#d4d4d4 or &#d4d4d4Ctrl+C&#d4d4d4 to copy the next message.
@player &#d4d4d4and use &#d4d4d4Alt+Tab&#d4d4d4 to switch between the browser and Minecraft.
@player 
@player &e&l4. &#d4d4d4&lLock your map!
@player &#d4d4d4Click the cartography table to lock it.
@player
@bypass playsound minecraft:block.note_block.harp master {{player}} ~ ~ ~ 1 1.5
